set.body:
Rebase GPCA onto Op, secondOrder, compress, FunctionalFrame, and OperatorProgram without prematurely deleting legacy symbols needed by unmigrated consumers.

Scope:
- SemanticGenPca and named GPCA builders compile to a GeneralizedRayleighRitz OperatorProgram;
- S_A = secondOrder(X, A, X), normalization and feature geometry are explicit typed operators;
- the fitted result is the generic certified fit with a FunctionalFrame and named derived scores/axes;
- existing entry points may remain temporarily as thin compatibility delegates to the new engine;
- no delegate may contain independent eigensolver logic or translate back into the legacy DualityDiagram/GenPca compute path;
- record each retained delegate in the purge inventory.

Acceptance:
- GenPcaRReferenceFixtures pass unchanged on JVM and JS;
- GenPca laws include direct dense and projector/subspace oracles, not only internal consistency;
- repeated spectra and singular geometry report numerical identifiability separately from algebraic subspace semantics;
- all GPCA computation runs through OperatorProgram and typed linalg capabilities;
- focused tests and dependency scan are green.
